        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PONGBANG</strong> is a digital board game inspired by Russian roulette, reimagined with a fun and strategic twist. Players take turns surviving high-stakes rounds while using item cards to prank, sabotage, or protect themselves. The last player standing wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling mix of luck, bluffing, and backstabbing — PONGBANG is perfect for parties and chaotic game nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player begins with 5 HP and must outlast everyone else to be the final survivor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only one gun and one bullet, players either shoot themselves or use cards to redirect the shot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action cards let you attack, defend, heal, reload, or trick opponents to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a chance to win thanks to randomized hit locations, where each spot inflicts different damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PONGBANG</strong> is a digital board game inspired by Russian roulette, reimagined with a fun and strategic twist. Players take turns surviving high-stakes rounds while using item cards to prank, sabotage, or protect themselves. The last player standing wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling mix of luck, bluffing, and backstabbing — PONGBANG is perfect for parties and chaotic game nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player begins with 5 HP and must outlast everyone else to be the final survivor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only one gun and one bullet, players either shoot themselves or use cards to redirect the shot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action cards let you attack, defend, heal, reload, or trick opponents to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a chance to win thanks to randomized hit locations, where each spot inflicts different damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
